# Cloudflare API token for DNS-01 certificate challenges
# Copy this file to cloudflare.ini and fill in your token.
# NEVER commit cloudflare.ini — it contains a secret.
#
# How to create the token:
#   1. Go to https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens
#   2. Click "Create Token" → use the "Edit zone DNS" template
#   3. Set "Zone Resources" → Include → Specific zone → snowfall.my
#   4. Click "Continue to summary" → "Create Token"
#   5. Paste the token below

dns_cloudflare_api_token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
